 ## How it works
 **Inputs:**
-- Query point $v = (x, y, z)$.
-- Quadric coefficients: $a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h, i, j$. These define the surface $ax^2 + by^2 + cz^2 + dxy + eyz + fzx + gx + hy + iz + j = 0$ [S1, unofficial].
